#: ../../index.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Pearl of the Orient. A field guide to research, enterprise and "
"possibility."
msgstr "东方明珠。连接科研、企业与机遇的实用图谱。"

#: ../../index.rst:6
msgid ""
"An illustrated English and Simplified Chinese guide for accelerators, "
"founders, researchers and AI enthusiasts. Explore Shanghai's districts, "
"universities, innovation programs, software and hardware AI, and the "
"practical routes to support."
msgstr "为加速器、创始人、研究者及人工智能爱好者编写的中英双语插图指南，探索上海各区、高校、创新计划、软件与硬件人工智能，以及获得支持的实用路径。"

